ata-start=\"772\" data-end=\"775\"><strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"790\">Toepassing:</strong> Montage, installatie, afbouw en onderhoud<br data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"835\"><strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"845\">Kleur:</strong> Rood / Zwart<br data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"861\"><strong data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"871\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"937\">📦 <strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"908\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"911\">Hilti B 22-55 Nuron Accu</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"996\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"961\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"964\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
